@page "/about-me"
@using Portfolio.Frontend.Components

<MudStack Spacing="20">
    <Section>
        <MudStack Spacing="10" Justify="Justify.Center" Class="mud-height-full">
            <SectionTitle>About me</SectionTitle>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h5">
                My name is Mauro Leonardo and I’m 21 years old. Since I was a child, I’ve been interested in
                technology:
                from trying to see if the fridge’s light goes out when the door is closed, to wanting to know
                how apps
                are coded and work behind the scenes. I always have something to say about a tech product, and
                I’m
                always interested in learning new things. I’m enthusiastic about talking about life or what’s
                going on
                in the world, or I work in silence when I’m in the zone trying to get things done.
            </MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h5">
                Learning new things is the reason I wake up in the morning, and luckily for me the IT-world is
                constantly evolving. I stay motivated to work on my projects because they can help people do
                their jobs. Working with my colleagues and getting things done is what makes me happy. I like planning
                things beforehand and never miss a deadline. I’m always the one keeping an eye
                on the time to make sure I get things done. I’m a team player, but I can also work individually
                if required. When you ask me to do something, you can count on it. I’m trustworthy, a lifelong
                learner and passionate about what I do.
            </MudText>
        </MudStack>
    </Section>

    <Section>
        <MudGrid Spacing="20" Justify="Justify.FlexStart">
            <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
                <MudStack Spacing="10">
                    <SectionTitle>Hobbies & Interests</SectionTitle>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.h5">
                        When I’m not behind my laptop, you can find me in nature during a relaxing walk or an intense
                        hike in
                        the Belgian Ardennes. I love being outdoors as much as coding, and that’s why I’ve been part of
                        the
                        Blauberg scouts for 15 years. When I’m behind my laptop during my free time, I like to play
                        games or
                        build small apps to help my friends or family. Shopping with my girlfriend or exploring Belgian
                        cities
                        helps me unwind, and I’m always ready to visit a theme park and get the adrenaline going!
                    </MudText>
                </MudStack>
            </MudItem>

            <MudItem xs="12" md="6">
                <MudStack Spacing="10">
                    <SectionTitle>Background</SectionTitle>
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.h5">
                        Throughout my studies, I built applications using different methodologies, from waterfall to
                        agile, and worked with technologies ranging from PHP to Flutter. I gained experience as a
                        developer, analyst, and scrum master, giving me a broad understanding of the development of
                        applications.
                        During my two internships at AllPhi, I developed two ASP.NET Core backends and strengthened
                        my understanding of enterprise architecture. I worked both independently and in team
                        settings and improved my .NET skills while learning frameworks like Blazor and Angular, as
                        well as tools such as Azure DevOps.
                    </MudText>
                </MudStack>
            </MudItem>
        </MudGrid>
    </Section>

    <MudSpacer/>

    <Section BackgroundColor="Color.Primary" Class="mud-tertiary-text">
        <MudStack Spacing="10">
            <SectionTitle>My Diplomas</SectionTitle>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h5">
                I have two IT-degrees: an associate degree in programming, and a bachelor’s degree in application
                development. I’ve studied for 4 years at the Thomas More University of Applied Sciences in Geel. I’ve
                learned how to work individually and in teams, and I’ve used a lot of different technologies to build
                application: from JavaScript to C# and Flutter.
            </MudText>

            <MudSpacer/>

            <MudGrid Spacing="20">
                <MudItem md="6">
                    <MudStack Spacing="4">
                        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5">
                            <b>Bachelor’s Degree Application Development<br/>Thomas More University of Applied
                                Science.</b>
                        </MudText>
                        <MudDivider/>
                        <MudStack>
                            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">
                                <b>Start of study:</b> September 2024
                            </MudText>
                            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">
                                <b>Graduated in:</b> June 2026
                            </MudText>
                            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">
                                <b>Duration of study:</b> 2 years
                            </MudText>
                        </MudStack>
                    </MudStack>
                </MudItem>

                <MudItem md="6">
                    <MudStack Spacing="4">
                        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5">
                            <b>Associate Degree of Programming<br/>Thomas More University of Applied Science.</b>
                        </MudText>
                        <MudDivider/>
                        <MudStack>
                            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">
                                <b>Start of study:</b> September 2022
                            </MudText>
                            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">
                                <b>Graduated in:</b> June 2024
                            </MudText>
                            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">
                                <b>Duration of study:</b> 2 years
                            </MudText>
                        </MudStack>
                    </MudStack>
                </MudItem>
            </MudGrid>
        </MudStack>
    </Section>
</MudStack>